  "title": {
   "en": "Tensei Nightingale wa Yoake o Utau ~Hakkou no Henkyou Reijou wa Kango no Chishiki de Kazoku to Ryouchi o Sukuimasu!~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "転生ナイチンゲールは夜明けを歌う～薄幸の辺境令嬢は看護の知識で家族と領地を救います！～"
   },
